# Jira Task

**Use for:** non-code or light chore work — docs, billing, ops, policy,
tracker hygiene — where a full Story/Bug AC pair is overkill.

**Do not use for:** feature development (→ `jira-story`) or product defects
(→ `jira-bug`).

## Create

Follow `jira-create`. Prefer an Epic parent when the chore belongs to a
milestone.

## Description

Minimum:

```markdown
## Overview

<What must happen and why.>
```

Add **Requirements** + **Acceptance Criteria** (per `jira-description`) when
the chore has multiple measurable musts. Skip the pair for a one-line chore
only when a cold reader still understands done from Overview alone.

## Done

A Task is done when the deliverable in Overview (and AC when present) is
complete. No PR is required unless the host repo says otherwise. Status
moves: `jira-status`.
